      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what are goblins doing in an aerodynamics lesson? I'm not really looking for magic or fantasy stories, I'm actually trying to study for a real flight exam. Can you please explain the physics of the pressure drop again, but without the goblin or wizard analogies? I really need to understand the actual fluid dynamics.",
